  clipPTBR: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 9758e54b1c18a914ba8ae3f781498dab, type: 3}
  subtitlePTBR: "Voc\xEA pode experimentar. Pegue os cubos, encaixe-os nas placas
    e reorganize como quiser. Observe que o computador possui uma quantidade limitada
    de placas. Isso define o tamanho do programa que voc\xEA pode criar."
  clipENUS: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f8f9292d39b4eb04388e7dc01572b0b4, type: 3}
  subtitleENUS: You can experiment. Take the cubes, place them on the boards, and
    rearrange them however you like. Notice that the computer has a limited number
    of boards. This defines the size of the program you can create.
